The goal model captures the mission’s complexity by decomposing it into hierarchical goals and tasks, incorporating parallel execution for efficiency, fallback mechanisms for robustness, and query goals for dynamic adaptation. The design ensures that the multi-robot system can handle resource collection, delivery, and failure scenarios while maintaining mission objectives.
